# Atlas World Project Rules

## Project Overview
Real-time multiplayer action-RPG powered by an authoritative Rust game server (`server-rs/`), a Godot 4.7 C# NativeAOT client (`game-client/`), shared TypeScript contracts (`contracts/`), a React web client (`client/react-client/`), and content/asset build tooling (`content/`, `atelier/`, `scripts/`).

The legacy `colyseus-server/` and `nakama/` runtimes are retired — simulation, meta persistence (`server-rs/src/meta/`), and Agones fleet lifecycle (`server-rs/src/fleet/`) all live in `server-rs/`.

